msgstr "GNOME Foundation"

#: donate/views.py:1418
msgid ""
"The GNOME Foundation is a 501(c)(3) non-profit corporation (EIN: "
"04-3572618). No goods or services were provided in exchange for these "
"contributions."
msgstr ""
"GNOME Foundation är ett ideellt 501(c)(3)-bolag (EIN: 04-3572618). Inga "
"varor eller tjänster tillhandahölls för dessa bidrag."

