#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:22
msgid "Alternatives"
msgstr "Alternativ"

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:28
msgid "Other Ways to Donate"
msgstr "Andra sätt att donera"

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:30
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Thanks for your interest in supporting the GNOME Foundation! Our "
"donation platform allows payments to be made by credit card, <em>SEPA Direct "
"Debit</em>, <em>Satispay</em>, and <em>Apple Pay</em>. If you'd prefer to "
"give another way, or you're able to give at a larger scale, we have other "
"payment options available. See below for details.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Tack för ditt intresse att stödja GNOME Foundation! Vår "
"donationsplattform tillåter betalningar via kreditkort, <em>SEPA Direct "
"Debit</em>, <em>Satispay</em> och <em>Apple Pay</em>. Om du föredrar att ge "
"på ett annat sätt, eller om du kan ge i större skala, så har vi andra "
"betalningsalternativ tillgängliga. Se nedan för detaljer.\n"
"        "

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:34
msgid "Employer matching"
msgstr "Arbetsgivarmatchning"

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:36
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Many employers match charitable gifts, which can double or more the "
"value of your donation. The GNOME Foundation is available on a number of "
"employer matching platforms, including <em>Benevity</em> and "
"<em>Cybergrants</em>. Search for “GNOME Foundation” in your employer's "
"giving portal, or ask your HR team how matching works at your company.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Många arbetsgivare matchar donationer till välgörenhet, vilket kan "
"öka värdet av din donation till det dubbla eller mer. GNOME Foundation är "
"tillgänglig på ett antal plattformar för arbetsgivarmatchning, inklusive "
"<em>Benevity</em> och <em>Cybergrants</em>. Sök ”GNOME Foundation” i din "
"arbetsgivares donationsportal, eller fråga din HR-enhet hur matchning "
"fungerar på ditt företag.\n"
"        "

# USA-specifikt koncept.
#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:40
msgid "Donor-advised funds (DAFs)"
msgstr "Donor-advised fund (DAF)"

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:42
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"        If you have a donor-advised fund, you can recommend a grant to the "
"GNOME Foundation through your provider. We are available on <em>Chariot</"
"em>, <em>Network for Good</em>, <em>YourCause</em> and <em>DAF Giving 360</"
"em>, and you can also search for us by name with any other DAF sponsor. Our "
"legal name is \"GNOME Foundation\" and our EIN is <b>043572618</b>. Our "
"address can be <a href=\"%(foundation_url)s\">found on our website</a>.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Om du har en ”donor-advised fund” kan du rekommendera en gåva till "
"GNOME Foundation genom din leverantör. Vi finns tillgängliga på <em>Chariot</"
"em>, <em>Network for Good</em>, <em>YourCause</em> och <em>DAF Giving 360</"
"em>, och du kan också söka oss efter namn med alla andra DAF-sponsorer. Vårt "
"juridiska namn \"GNOME Foundation\" och vår EIN är <b>043572618</b>. Vår "
"adress kan <a href=\"%(foundation_url)s\">hittas på vår webbplats</a>.\n"
"        "

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:46
msgid "Larger gifts"
msgstr "Större gåvor"

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:48
msgid ""
"\n"
"        For donations over $100, we can accept other payment methods, "
"including (but not limited to) ACH, Bill.com, PayPal, check, and wire "
"transfer. We also accept Bitcoin.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        För donationer över $100 kan vi acceptera andra betalningsmetoder, "
"inklusive (men inte begränsat till) ACH, Bill.com, PayPal, check och "
"banköverföring. Vi accepterar också Bitcoin.\n"
"        "

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:53
msgid ""
"\n"
"        To arrange a gift, contact us and we'll be happy to send you the "
"details.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        För att arrangera en gåva, kontakta oss så skickar vi dig gärna "
"detaljerna.\n"
"        "

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:57
msgid "Help and queries"
msgstr "Hjälp och frågor"

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:59
msgid ""
"\n"
"        For information about how to donate to the GNOME Foundation, please "
"don't hesitate to contact us.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        För information om hur du kan donera till GNOME Foundation, tveka "
"inte att kontakta oss.\n"
"        "

#: templates/gnome/alternatives.html:64 templates/gnome/help.html:103
#: templates/gnome/includes/footer.html:5
msgid "Contact Us"
msgstr "Kontakta oss"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:23
#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:30
msgid "Corporate Sponsorships"
msgstr "Företagssponsringar"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:32
msgid ""
"Are you part of a company, government agency, university department, or non-"
"profit interested in funding GNOME? In addition to supporting the future of "
"an independent software platform, corporate sponsors also have their logos "
"added to the GNOME website and promotional materials."
msgstr ""
"Är du del av ett företag, en myndighet, universitetsinstitution, eller "
"ideell förening intresserad av att stödja GNOME? Utöver att stödja framtiden "
"för en oberoende programvaruplattform så får företagssponsorer också sin "
"logotyp tillagd på GNOMEs webbplats och reklammaterial."

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:37
msgid "Support tiers and benefits"
msgstr "Stödnivåer och fördelar"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:40
msgid "Copper"
msgstr "Koppar"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:41
msgid "Bronze"
msgstr "Brons"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:42
msgid "Silver"
msgstr "Silver"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:43
msgid "Gold"
msgstr "Guld"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:47
msgid "Name and URL on website"
msgstr "Namn och URL på webbplats"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:52
msgid "Logo on website"
msgstr "Logotyp på webbplats"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:58
msgid "Yearly mention on social media"
msgstr "Årliga omnämnanden i sociala medier"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:63
msgid "Acknowledgement in reports and at events"
msgstr "Tillkännagivande i rapporter och på evenemang"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:71
