#, python-format
msgid "%(symbol)s%(amount)s/month"
msgstr "%(symbol)s%(amount)s/månad"

#: templates/gnome/corporate-sponsorships.html:97
#, python-format
msgid ""
"As an alternative to sponsorship, you can make a <a "
"href=\"%(onetime_url)s\">one-time donation</a>.<br>Having a problem with "
"your sponsorship? Visit our <a href=\"%(help_url)s\">help page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Som ett alternativ till sponsring kan du göra en <a "
"href=\"%(onetime_url)s\">engångsdonation</a>.<br>Har du problem med din "
"sponsring? Besök vår <a href=\"%(help_url)s\">hjälpsida</a>."

#: templates/gnome/help.html:31
msgid "Donation Help"
msgstr "Donationshjälp"

#: templates/gnome/help.html:34
msgid ""
"Thanks for your interest in donating to the GNOME Foundation! This page "
"contains answers to the most common questions about donating."
msgstr ""
"Tack för ditt intresse för att donera till GNOME Foundation! Denna sida "
"innehåller svar till de vanligaste frågorna om donationer."

#: templates/gnome/help.html:37
msgid "Which payment methods are available?"
msgstr "Vilka betalningsmetoder finns?"

#: templates/gnome/help.html:40
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Our platform allows payments to be made by credit card, SEPA Direct "
"Debit, Satispay, and Apple Pay. Some of\n"
"        these payment methods are only available in certain countries and "
"currencies.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Vår plattform tillåter betalning från kreditkord, SEPA Direct Debit, "
"Satispay och Apple Pay. Vissa av\n"
"        dessa betalningsmetoder är endast tillgängliga i vissa länder och "
"valutor.\n"
"        "

#: templates/gnome/help.html:46
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Our <a href=\"%(alternatives_url)s\">other ways to donate</a> page "
"contains details on other payment methods. If none of these work for you, "
"please\n"
"        feel free to reach out using the contact link below.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Vår sida för <a href=\"%(alternatives_url)s\">andra sätt att donera</"
"a> innehåller detaljer om andra betalningsmetoder. Hör gärna av dig\n"
"        med kontaktlänken nedan om ingen av dessa fungerar för dig.\n"
"        "

#: templates/gnome/help.html:52
msgid "Which currencies can I donate?"
msgstr "Vilka valutor kan jag donera?"

#: templates/gnome/help.html:55
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Our platform allows donations in US dollars and Euros only. If you "
"would like to donate a larger amount in a\n"
"        different currency, please get in touch using our contact form.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Vår plattform tillåter endast donationer i USA-dollar och Euro. Om "
"du vill donera en större summa i en annan\n"
"        valuta kan du kontakta oss genom vårt kontaktformulär.\n"
"        "

#: templates/gnome/help.html:61
msgid "How do I change my recurring donation?"
msgstr "Hur ändrar jag min återkommande donation?"

#: templates/gnome/help.html:64
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We use Stripe to process payments, and you can use the <a "
"href=\"%(stripe_customer_portal_url)s\">Stripe customer portal</a> to update "
"your email address, change the monthly donation amount, or cancel your "
"subscription."
msgstr ""
"Vi använder Stripe för att bearbeta betalningar, och du kan använda <a "
"href=\"%(stripe_customer_portal_url)s\">Stripe-kundportalen</a> för att "
"uppdatera din e-postadress, ändra det månatliga donationsbeloppet, eller "
"avbryta din prenumeration."

#: templates/gnome/help.html:70
msgid "How do I change my name on the Friends of GNOME list?"
msgstr "Hur ändrar jag mitt namn i Friends of GNOME-listan?"

#: templates/gnome/help.html:73
msgid ""
"To change the name shown on the donors list, request <a "
"href=\"profile_link_request_url\">a profile link</a>. Once you've received "
"the link, you can use the link to change your visibility, name, avatar, and "
"contact preferences."
msgstr ""
"För att ändra namnet som visas på donatorlistan, begär <a "
"href=\"profile_link_request_url\">en profillänk</a>. Då du har tagit emot "
"länken, kan du använda den för att ändra profilens synlighet, namn, "
"profilbild och kontaktinställningar."

#: templates/gnome/help.html:79
msgid ""
"Is my donation tax-deductible? How do I get proof of my donation for tax "
"purposes?"
msgstr ""
"Är min donation avdragsgill? Hur kan jag bevisa min donation i skattesyfte?"

#: templates/gnome/help.html:82
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"        The GNOME Foundation is a 501c(3) non-profit corporation, and "
"donations are tax-deductible in the USA. If you\n"
"        need a receipt for your taxes you can <a "
