"        "

#: templates/gnome/help.html:88
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Donations to the GNOME Foundation are typically not tax deductible "
"outside of the USA. However, you may be able to get tax\n"
"        relief if you donate through an intermediary, such as a Donor "
"Advised Fund or employer donation matching scheme.\n"
"        See <a href=\"%(alternatives_url)s\">other donation methods</a> for "
"more information.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Donationer till GNOME Foundation är vanligen inte avdragsgilla "
"utanför USA. Du kan dock möjligen få skattelättnader om du\n"
"        donerar genom en mellanhand, såsom en ”Donor Advised Fund” eller "
"donationsmatchningsplan hos din arbetsgivare.\n"
"        Se <a href=\"%(alternatives_url)s\">andra donationsmetoder</a> för "
"mer information.\n"
"        "

#: templates/gnome/help.html:95
